<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shwe Yati Oo</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f7ede2;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .profile-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            max-width: 380px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .img-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 380px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .img-container img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .name {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2b2d42;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #ffe5ec;
            color: #ff4d6d;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .info-list {
            text-align: left;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .info-item {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4a5568;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .info-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #718096;
        }

        .quote {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
            font-style: italic;
            line-height: 1.5;
            border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        .heart {
            color: #ff4d6d;
            display: inline-block;
            animation: beat 1.2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes beat {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="profile-card">
        <div class="img-container">
            <!-- ဓာတ်ပုံဖိုင်အမည်ကို ဒီနေရာမှာ ထည့်ပါ -->
            <img src="shwe_yati_oo.jpg" alt="Shwe Yati Oo">
        </div>

        <div class="name">Shwe Yati Oo</div>
        <div class="status-badge">Single 💖</div>

        <div class="info-list">
            <div class="info-item">
                <span class="label">မွေးနေ့:</span>
                <span>Dec 28, 2005</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-item">
                <span class="label">ပညာအရည်အချင်း:</span>
                <span>G12 ရိုးရိုးအောင်</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quote">
            "ချစ်စရာကောင်းတဲ့ အပြုံးလေးတွေနဲ့ ဆွဲဆောင်မှုရှိတဲ့ သူလေး <span class="heart">✨</span>"
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
